<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Book Borrow Confirmation</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #f3f4f6;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            padding: 30px;
            color: #333;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 25px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .header {
            border-bottom: 2px solid #4a90e2;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .header h2 {
            margin: 0;
            color: #4a90e2;
        }
        .content p {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .details {
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            border-left: 4px solid #4a90e2;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .details p {
            margin: 5px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 13px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #999;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h2>📚 Book Borrowed Successfully</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <p>Hello {{ user.email }},</p>
        <p>Thank you for borrowing a book from our library. Here are the details of your transaction:</p>
        <div class="details">
            <p><strong>Book Title:</strong> {{ book.title }}</p>
            <p><strong>Borrowed On:</strong> {{ loan.loanedAt | date('l, jS F Y') }}</p>
            <p><strong>Return By:</strong> {{ loan.dueAt | date('l, jS F Y') }}</p>
        </div>
        <p>Please make sure to return the book on time to avoid any late fees.</p>
        <p>Happy Reading!<br><strong>{{ app_name|default('Library System') }}</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
